### Work Completed

All instructions in [`prompts/chore-02.md`](file:///C:/Users/user/Documents/ecommerce-latest/prompts/chore-02.md) and [`AGENTS.md`](file:///C:/Users/user/Documents/ecommerce-latest/AGENTS.md) have been carried out. Work was completed in two separate commits on the working branch `chore/batch-01`:

1. **Commit 1 (`f232c66`): `test(store): set NODE_ENV to test in vitest config to provide React.act`**
   - **Root Cause Diagnosed:** `@testing-library/react@16.3.2` already supports React 19 and checks `typeof React.act === 'function' ? React.act : DeprecatedReactTestUtils.act`. However, in React 19, `act` is only exported from `cjs/react.development.js` and is stripped from `cjs/react.production.js`. When ambient `NODE_ENV=production` is set in the host/process environment, React loaded its production bundle where `React.act` is `undefined`, causing `@testing-library/react` to fall back to `react-dom/test-utils`' deprecated stub which threw `TypeError: React.act is not a function`.
   - **Fix:** Added `test.env: { NODE_ENV: "test" }` to [`artifacts/store/vitest.config.ts`](file:///C:/Users/user/Documents/ecommerce-latest/artifacts/store/vitest.config.ts), ensuring Vitest workers load the development React bundle and cleanly provide `React.act` without modifying or skipping any tests.

2. **Commit 2 (`70c7dc7`): `chore(test): split unit and integration test tiers and document run requirements`**
   - Added `"test:unit"` (`vitest --run --project store-unit --project env-validation`) and `"test:integration"` (`vitest --run --project api-integration`) to [`package.json`](file:///C:/Users/user/Documents/ecommerce-latest/package.json), while keeping `"test"` running everything.
   - Updated [`artifacts/api-server/tests/setup.ts`](file:///C:/Users/user/Documents/ecommerce-latest/artifacts/api-server/tests/setup.ts) to load `.env.test` first, then `.env` as fallback (giving `.env.test` precedence).
   - Created [`.env.test.example`](file:///C:/Users/user/Documents/ecommerce-latest/.env.test.example) with empty values and descriptive comments for all integration tier variables, and added `!.env.test.example` to [`.gitignore`](file:///C:/Users/user/Documents/ecommerce-latest/.gitignore).
   - Added a "Test tiers and commands" section to [`.agents/rules/testing.md`](file:///C:/Users/user/Documents/ecommerce-latest/.agents/rules/testing.md).
   - Documented all changes, prompt contradictions, and decisions in [`docs/audits/chore-02-notes.md`](file:///C:/Users/user/Documents/ecommerce-latest/docs/audits/chore-02-notes.md).

