### Tiers Not Run Locally and Why
- **`api-integration` (`pnpm run test:integration`)**: Not run locally because this checkout does not contain a local `.env` or `.env.test` with Supabase project secrets (`SUPABASE_URL`, `SUPABASE_ANON_KEY`, `SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY`) nor a running API server on port 5000. When executed without these, `setup.ts` correctly and loudly fails at collection with:
  ```
  Error: Missing required environment variable: SUPABASE_URL. Ensure it is defined in .env or .env.test at the repository root.
  ```
  This suite runs in CI (`.github/workflows/test.yml`) where GitHub Actions secrets and a running server are provisioned.
